{"v":4,"catch":"小英雄奮鬥！\n鼓起勇氣面對邪惡的敵人！！","desc":"《RABIO LEPUS》是VIDEO SYSTEM於1987年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n突然，外星人襲擊了和平國度“BUNNYLAND”，國王、公主和公主的妹妹被綁架。\n皇家特戰機甲“USAGI”出擊，打倒外星boss“YOUMAOU”，解救人質！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-07-07","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c556bdef1bf3035f44095214758e4cc0ca9d0ee7fa12d68df30fe9dc9d10e19.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/630fc2ccee8bffda8778d09535991f22e699bb673fe5c55f8af08a9f38c8ad8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff479a2548373850c87005f9b6d0410eb3635bfab980f8992092773cd6297d0c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21e953045f28562554ee9a7b0b61b3bd70431470c046b3eb98f1cbe2d24f4ed6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2b8bcc20bdf0c881833c930c667cfdf37593765b15fcb059a00fe952b6387a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/132ebed51ef85d5cd45e07e319114eb006f16d80be70ced123b26757331e1e1d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c84018338000","dlc":[]}